  "story_path": "user_stories/new-command-names.md",
  "criteria": [
    {"id": "AC1", "text": "`pdd --help` lists `pdd test`, `pdd lint`, `pdd simulate` and `pdd workflow run`, never says \"pdd check\", \"pdd try\" or \"workflow start\", prints nothing to stderr and exits with code 0."},
    {"id": "AC2", "text": "`pdd test --help` lists the `pdd test` forms with --read, --retry, --fill-hash, --files and --screen, prints nothing to stderr and exits with code 0."},
    {"id": "AC3", "text": "`pdd lint --help` lists the `pdd lint` forms, including `pdd lint --local`, prints nothing to stderr and exits with code 0."},
    {"id": "AC4", "text": "`pdd check --help` prints nothing to stdout, prints one line to stderr that names `pdd check` and `pdd test`, and exits with code 2."},
    {"id": "AC5", "text": "`pdd check --lint --help` and `pdd check new-command-names --lint` each print nothing to stdout, print one line to stderr that names `pdd check --lint` and `pdd lint`, and exit with code 2."},
    {"id": "AC6", "text": "`pdd try --help` prints nothing to stdout, prints one line to stderr that names `pdd try` and `pdd simulate`, and exits with code 2."},
    {"id": "AC7", "text": "`pdd help check` and `pdd help try` each print nothing to stdout, print one line to stderr that names the old and the new command, and exit with code 2."},
    {"id": "AC8", "text": "`pdd check new-command-names --json`, `pdd check --bogus` and `pdd try new-command-names --new` each print nothing to stdout, print one line to stderr that names the old and the new command, and exit with code 2."},
    {"id": "AC9", "text": "`pdd workflow run --help` prints the `pdd workflow run` help to stdout, prints nothing to stderr and exits with code 0."},
    {"id": "AC10", "text": "`pdd workflow start --help` prints the same `pdd workflow run` help to stdout, never says \"workflow start\", prints nothing to stderr and exits with code 0."},
    {"id": "AC11", "text": "`pdd workflow run 81` still prints only \"Name the workflow: pdd workflow run small-change 81 (or bug, feature). See pdd workflow list.\" to stderr, prints nothing to stdout and exits with code 2."},
    {"id": "AC12", "text": "`pdd workflow start 81` prints only the same line, \"Name the workflow: pdd workflow run small-change 81 (or bug, feature). See pdd workflow list.\", to stderr, prints nothing to stdout and exits with code 2."},
    {"id": "AC13", "text": "`pdd test --bogus` prints a usage error to stderr, with no \"Unknown command\" and no \"was removed\", prints nothing to stdout and exits with code 2."},
    {"id": "AC14", "text": "`pdd sim --help` prints the `pdd simulate` help to stdout, prints nothing to stderr and exits with code 0."}
  ],
